# Optional: Firebase authentication + cloud sync. Paste your Firebase web
# app config as ONE line of JSON. If set, the app gates /app behind a
# sign-in screen (email/password + magic link + Google + Apple) and syncs
# projects/presets to Firestore. If unset, the app runs auth-free and
# projects live in localStorage. See README.md → "Authentication (optional)".
#
# Where to get it: Firebase console → Project settings → Your apps → SDK
# setup and configuration → Config, or:
#   firebase apps:sdkconfig WEB <appId>
#
# Example (not a real project):
# VITE_FIREBASE_CONFIG={"apiKey":"AIza...","authDomain":"my-app.firebaseapp.com","projectId":"my-app","storageBucket":"my-app.firebasestorage.app","messagingSenderId":"123456","appId":"1:123456:web:abc123"}

VITE_FIREBASE_CONFIG=
